{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "janusopolis-ritual-manual",
  "name": "Janusopolis Ritual Manual",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Janusopolis_Ritual_Manual",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-28T09:31:09.357Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Prologue"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "This manual is the guidance of the tripartite prophecy,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "may Janus bestow upon us paths,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "may Talanton bestow upon us fairness,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "and may Oronyx bestow upon us revelations."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bcbaa7454f8cd0ca"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chapter 1: Ritual Hours"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Morning Ritual (Entry Hour)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. When opening the door of the temple, one must pray to Janus first."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Light the three everbright lamps to symbolize the tripartite of destiny."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Sweep the floors of the temple and change the offerings."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8c663ec5b5510bf8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dawn Ritual (Lucid Hour)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Recite the Tripartite Ode."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Record the questions asked by the visitors."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Prepare offerings."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9502d41d1129da79"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dusk Ritual (Parting Hour)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Light incense sticks to purify the altar."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Place the offerings of the day."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Recite the oracle's text."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b6b5d37dcb1da428"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chapter 2: Ritual Rules"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Basic Rules"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Follow Talanton's Words: The offerings must bear the same weight as the prayer. This is the law of the scale, and must not be disobeyed."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-83a7375e938fec90"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Common Offerings and Their meanings"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Balance Coins: symbolizes the changes of destiny."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Crystals: symbolizes the clarity of the prophecies."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Honey: symbolizes the sweetness of languages."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Clothes: symbolizes the curtain of Oronyx."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Mirrors: symbolizes the two faces of Janus."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "6. Scale: symbolizes the fairness of Talanton."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Note: Offerings must be complete and of the purest quality."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-398845925cc38574"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Taboos"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. One must not offer items of misfortune."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. One must not offer items of others."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. One must not offer items during the Entry Hour."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5bcfc4b021e45c1b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chapter 3: Prayer"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Morning Ritual"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lady of the paths shall show us the way, the king of fairness shall keep the balance, and the spirit of the night shall grand us wisdom. I knock on the door to ask for an audience with the divine, I make offerings to ask about the Hereafter, and I bow down to ask for guidance."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-70ea55f4dd16c4f1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Inquiry Prayer"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Life is but a leaf, adrift with waves. Tripartite fate, to what end does it lead? Janus illuminates my path, Talanton steadies my course, and Oronyx shows me the truth."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9064320e46b9f765"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Gratitude Prayer"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I thank the tripartite fate for heeding me and offering guidance. May the eternal shine never dim, and may the divine words forever endure."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-df90ebd32c2033c8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chapter 4: Prophecy Rules"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Preparation"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. The maiden must bathe and purify herself."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. She must wear a white ritual robe and a silver mask."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. She must hold the two-faced staff of Janus."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. She must light the tri-colored holy fire."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-998cf60bb02f529f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Prophecy Procedures"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. The assistant priest will light the incense and guide the way."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. The maiden will ascend to the seat of destiny."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. The visitor will place their offerings."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. The maiden will read the revelations."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. The maiden will read the prophecy once destiny indicates the result."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bcec01d8e4e5894a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Prophetic Records"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. All prophecies must be recorded on special sheepskin scrolls."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Prophecies must be recorded with ink made from silver powder."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Three witnesses must provide their signatures."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Prophecies will be kept in a secret chamber within the room of prophecy."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c19efb97489addd4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chapter 5: Special Ceremonies"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "New Moon Ceremony"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The New Moon ritual must be held at the beginning of every month. At that time:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. All the gates of the tripartite temple shall be opened."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. A twelve-sided mirror shall be placed to symbolize the wheel of destiny."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. The maiden shall lead everyone around the temple three times."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. The Long Ballad of Fate shall be recited."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7ea465be50f419aa"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Janus' Maze Revelational Ceremony"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Exclusively held for important questions:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Set up an inquiry magic circle."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. The maiden casts a curse to open the gateway."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Place a double-sided mirror into the magic circle."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Decipher the reflection in the mirror."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Record the revelation."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d1efcd7817d27566"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Afterword"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This manual was created and edited by the maidens of past generations. May these rules be followed to obtain the truth. Violators shall face the punishment of destiny."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5e80c0caf646010e"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
